Iti barunga arak ti ubas,

80
00:04:58,060 --> 00:04:59,420
Iji pagaryan ni ama.

81
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:01,900
Kalpasan ti panangkantada,

82
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,220
Iti maisang ahimno,

83
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:06,400
Rimwarda anapan iji bantay olivo,

84
00:05:07,060 --> 00:05:08,800
Kinunani hesus kadakwada.

85
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:10,860
Iti daytoy matlaarabi,

86
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,840
Panawan dakto.

87
