234
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:33,900
Isa patam itinagaan ti si Bibiyak

235
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:35,600
a Diyos kat ibagam kada kami

236
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,580
no si kati Kristo nga anak ti Diyos.

237
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:39,180
Nasa umon,

238
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,360
insungbat ni Jesus,

239
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:43,740
ngam kunak kada kayo amin.

240
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:45,660
Makita yun to

241
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:47,660
ti anak ti tao as iti tugaw

242
00:11:47,660 --> 00:11:50,240
iti makanawan ti man nakabalin amin.

243
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:52,980
Makita yun to nga umay

244
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:54,080
kada gitit ulip

245
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:54,760
ti langit.

246
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:57,960
Itikasta, rinayab ti kang atuan

247
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,800
na padi ti paggananay na.

248
00:12:00,620 --> 00:12:01,920
Ininsultuan na ti Diyos.

249
00:12:02,420 --> 00:12:03,700
Anya paila ti pakasapulan

250
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:04,720
tayo kada kiti saksi.

251
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:06,160
Kinunana,

252
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,380
nang ngayon nagiti sa una

253
00:12:08,380 --> 00:12:09,900
ama ikaniwas iti Diyos.

254
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:11,600
Anya ti pangad ngayon?

255
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:13,340
Nakabasol!

256
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:15,080
Insungbat da.

257
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:17,080
Masapol amatay.

258
00:12:17,900 --> 00:12:19,600
Kit tinupratupraan da

259
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,440
at tirupan na

260
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:22,160
kin dinanugdanug da

261
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,920
tinungpatong padamat

262
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,140
dagiti da duma.

263
00:12:25,900 --> 00:12:27,200
Pagtuaman Kristo

264
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:29,460
nung si asino tinangtong pakingka?

265
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:32,100
Kinunada,

266
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:33,580
agtugtugao ni

267
00:12:33,580 --> 00:12:35,120
Pedro iti paraangan

268
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:37,880
idi umasidig kinkuan at timaysang

269
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,340
nga adipen a babae

270
00:12:39,340 --> 00:12:40,340
anagkuna.

271
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:43,500
Uray sika, nakikadkadwa kamatkin

272
00:12:43,500 --> 00:12:45,360
ni Jesus at agagaliliya.

273
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,880
Ngam naglibak ni Pedro

274
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:49,880
itisangwanan da amin.

275
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:51,400
Jakam mo

276
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:52,380
tisa sawam.

277
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:55,360
Kinunana, rimwar ni Pedro

278
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,720
anagturong itiruangan

279
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:59,800
nakita ti sa baling adipen a babae

280
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:01,940
kit kinunana kada kititataw

281
00:13:01,940 --> 00:13:02,460
sa jay.

282
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,380
Kinunana,

283
00:13:03,580 --> 00:13:09,420
naglibak manin ni Pedro

284
00:13:09,420 --> 00:13:10,920
kit kinunana.

285
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:13,640
Isa patak at jakam-am mo

286
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,780
daita atao.

287
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:16,820
Itisaan na mabayad

288
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:19,600
imasidig kinkuan na dagititataw

289
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,180
ngagtaktakder sa jay.

290
00:13:21,900 --> 00:13:24,100
Agpaiso amay saka kadakwada.

291
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:25,500
Kinunada,

292
00:13:26,260 --> 00:13:27,500
daita bingat mo

293
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:28,680
ti pakailasinan.

294
00:13:29,420 --> 00:13:31,140
Uray dosaan nakti Diyos

295
00:13:31,140 --> 00:13:33,120
nosaan apod no ti ibagbagak.

296
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:35,700
In sapatan ni Pedro,

297
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:38,700
jakam-am mo daita atao.

298
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:39,940
Pagamuan,

299
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:42,820
nagtaraok ti may sa akawitan

300
00:13:42,820 --> 00:13:44,380
ket nalagip ni Pedro

301
00:13:44,380 --> 00:13:46,840
ti imbaga ni Jesus kinkuanan.

302
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:50,140
Sakbay ti pa nagtaraok ti kawitan,

303
00:13:50,140 --> 00:13:52,080
namit luntun ni imbagam

304
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:54,200
adinak am-am mo.

305
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,840
Rimwar ni Pedro

306
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:57,840
ket nagsangit itinasayam.

